@startuml
title US021 – "As a Buyer, I want to get the list of items on direct sale of a given genre" - System Sequence Diagram

'==== basic style ====
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953
skinparam ActivationBackgroundColor black
hidefootbox

actor User
participant "MiteLovers" as System

User -> System: I want the list of items, on direct sale, of a given genre.
activate System
System --> User: What is the genre?
deactivate System
User -> System: Genre.
activate System
System --> User: Here is the list!
deactivate System

@enduml